{"id":69730,"date":"2025-12-30T11:52:21","date_gmt":"2025-12-30T10:52:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69730"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:55:34","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:55:34","slug":"meia-maratona-vigo-bayona","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-vigo-bayona\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona Vigo-Bayona 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona Vigo-Bayona 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona Vigo-Bayona 2027<\/strong> (26\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Gran Bah\u00eda Vig-Bay<\/strong> e 6\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Minibay<\/strong>) realiza-se no dia <strong>11 de Abril de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo), unindo a cidade de <strong>Vigo<\/strong> \u00e0 hist\u00f3rica vila costeira de <strong>Baiona<\/strong>, na Galiza, <strong>Espanha<\/strong>. Reconhecida como a meia maratona com maior participa\u00e7\u00e3o da Galiza e uma das provas internacionais favoritas dos corredores portugueses pela sua proximidade ao Norte de Portugal, oferece uma jornada atl\u00e9tica vibrante sob o lema <em>\u00ab\u00a1A toda costa!\u00bb<\/em>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra duas dist\u00e2ncias lineares em asfalto que percorrem os munic\u00edpios costeiros de <strong>Vigo<\/strong>, <strong>Nigr\u00e1n<\/strong> e <strong>Baiona<\/strong>: a cl\u00e1ssica <strong>Meia Maratona Vig-Bay (21,097 km)<\/strong>, com partida na <strong>Avenida de Samil<\/strong> (Vigo) \u00e0s 10:00 (09:45 para a categoria de cadeiras de rodas e handbike), e a <strong>Minibay (10,548 km)<\/strong> \u2014 <em>\u00abDe la media, la mitad\u00bb<\/em> \u2014, com partida \u00e0s 09:30 em <strong>Playa Am\u00e9rica<\/strong> (Nigr\u00e1n). Todo o tra\u00e7ado desenvolve-se com o Oceano Atl\u00e2ntico, a <strong>Ria de Vigo<\/strong> e o arquip\u00e9lago das <strong>Ilhas C\u00edes<\/strong> como pano de fundo, culminando na meta instalada na ba\u00eda de Baiona, junto \u00e0 Fortaleza de Monterreal.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Club de Corredores Vig-Bay<\/strong>, a prova assegura uma log\u00edstica de excel\u00eancia que inclui levantamento de dorsais no <strong>Museo VERBUM \u2013 Casa de las Palabras<\/strong> (Samil), partidas organizadas por caixas de tempo com lebres oficiais (<em>pacers<\/em> entre 1h30 e 2h00), servi\u00e7o de autocarros entre Baiona e Vigo, servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro (recolha de roupa com entrega na meta), abastecimentos l\u00edquidos a cada 5 km e vertente de <strong>Dorsal Solid\u00e1rio<\/strong> a favor do Centro Juan Mar\u00eda de Educa\u00e7\u00e3o Especial em Nigr\u00e1n.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">11 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida de Samil, Vigo, Espanha<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" styl